(label "L4" (at 394.97 99.06 180) (fields_autoplaced yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right bottom)) (uuid "ff894268-49c9-55a7-8372-70db98c46788"))
(label "L8" (at 402.59 99.06 0) (fields_autoplaced yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "4a7749ef-0057-5cf3-9168-9ff7dc5beff5"))
(text "LED WATCH - charlieplexed display" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 203.20 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "cf72640f-8943-55d4-ab96-f17fd1b003cb"))
(text "D1-D60: minute LEDs, Dn = minute n-1 (D1 at 12 o'clock, clockwise). D61-D72: hour LEDs, D61 = 12 o'clock." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 203.20 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "890edb04-4b27-59d6-9725-eac3b114914c"))
(text "Each LED: K -> cathode line, A -> anode line. Lines L0-L8 drive through R1-R9 from the MCU (Lk_M)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 203.20 25.40 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "e5d95286-6d72-5810-ab75-477a8ea8602f"))
(text "Lit LED: anode line high, cathode line low, other 7 lines Hi-Z. One LED on at a time." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 203.20 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "6bfc6ac1-c328-5e9b-b67c-39100bb78615"))
(text "MCU lines: L0=PA3, L1=PA4, L2=PA5, L3=PA6, L4=PA7, L5=PB7, L6=PB6, L7=PB5, L8=PB4" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 25.40 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "cf73d835-b347-5c0c-8003-337a54736a9e"))
(text "Buttons: SW_A=PC2 (show time, async pin), SW_B=PC3. ACC_INT=PC0. I2C: SDA=PB1 SCL=PB0 (LIS2DH12 addr 0x19)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "bc35f15a-8d5c-57c5-a325-53170e00fe67"))
(text "UPDI=PA0, TX=PA1 (USART0 alt). XTAL on TOSC1/TOSC2 (PB3/PB2). BT1 -> Q1 reverse-polarity P-FET -> VDD." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 35.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "d23ebd3f-e14a-50e0-8ff1-6f33a2e114f0"))
(text "No VDD pad on purpose: program from the cell (UPDI + GND). Never feed VDD with a cell fitted: Q1 conducts both ways." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 40.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "721a18f1-0d6a-5999-be82-b2ffa5832445"))
(text "RTC = PA2 (EVOUT0) test pad for crystal calibration. D73/D74 ESD footprints not fitted." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 45.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "30efa261-1c33-5611-a077-a81019538c2a"))
